  "document": "Straw Dogs (2011 film)\nStraw Dogs is a 2011 American psychological thriller film directed, produced, and written by Rod Lurie. It is a remake of Sam Peckinpah's 1971 film \"Straw Dogs\", itself lightly based on the Gordon Williams novel \"The Siege of Trencher's Farm\". It stars James Marsden and Kate Bosworth."
